  "article_opening": "Valar Atomics just made history in the Utah desert by connecting a next-generation nuclear reactor directly to an Nvidia AI chip — a first in America — and the implications for the data center industry's biggest PR crisis go far beyond one desktop PC drawing power on a stage.\nThe reactor cooling itself with pressurized helium instead of water is the quiet technical detail that changes everything about where AI infrastructure can be built next.\nWith over $130 billion in data center projects alrea",
